# Normalize line endings on checkin and check out LF everywhere.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic. `scripts/build_index.py --check` compares
# the generated bytes of skills/index.json and CATALOG.md against the committed
# ones. A CRLF checkout on Windows would report drift that does not exist and
# fail CI for a contributor who changed nothing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
